# Store text files with LF in the repository regardless of the platform they
# were written on, so Windows checkouts don't show every line as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Source dataset: keep byte-for-byte. Line-ending conversion would rewrite
# 1.4M lines in votes.psv and change the files the importer reads.
data/** -text

# Binary assets
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
